## New Environment Variables

| Variable | Default | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `LLM_TIMEOUT` | `30` | HTTP timeout in seconds for LLM API calls |
| `QUERY_EXPANSION_MAX_QUERIES` | `8` | Maximum expanded queries to return |

All other LLM settings (`LLM_API_KEY`, `LLM_MODEL`, `LLM_TEMPERATURE`, `LLM_MAX_TOKENS`, `LLM_PROVIDER`) were pre-existing.

